<title>BELGIUM: Belgium holds liquidity steady at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgium holds liquidity steady at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank left unchanged money market liquidity at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date 19/03	  expiry on 26/03    NBVA</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   7.025 bln	   (7.025 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    127.325 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  5.32</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on 19/03</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on March 10</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
